      "content": "I hear how much pain and isolation you are carrying, and I want you to know that your self-worth is not defined by a past failure or the fear of a \"fixed\" identity. Feelings of worthlessness can be overwhelming and persistent, but they do not reflect the true reality of you or the love and trust you have built with your parents. You might consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can help you navigate these heavy emotions and explore ways to reclaim your sense of self.",
